#: ../../library/kibana.rst:7
msgid ""
"In this example we will build out a new Kibana Library item to automate "
"the installation and configuration of Kibana. This simple example "
"utilizes all sections of the Library including Inputs, File Templates and"
" Scripts."
msgstr ""
"In este/esta example we será/n build fuera un/una nuevo/nueva Kibana "
"Library item a automate el/la installation y configuration de Kibana. "
"Este/Esta simple example utilizes todos/todas sections de el/la Library "
"including Inputs, Plantillas de archivo y Scripts."

