#: ../../library/kibana.rst:89
msgid ""
"For this example we will be offering version selection at provision time "
"through an Input. While we could add version selection by adding Node "
"Types and/or Layouts for each version, because we will be installing "
"Kibana with a script, we can grab the version though an Input and inject "
"the associated url into the script using an Input variable."
msgstr ""
"For este/esta example we será/n be offering version selection en "
"provision time a través de un/una Input. Mientras we could add version "
"selection por adding Tipos de nodo and/or Layouts para cada version, "
"because we será/n be installing Kibana con un/una script, we puede/n grab"
" el/la version though un/una Input y inject el/la asociado/asociada url "
"en el/la script using un/una Input variable."

